Compile each WebGPU kernel from its own shader module and its pipelines in parallel. The code
generator marks where each kernel's declarations begin; the runtime compiles the shared part as
the pipeline's module and each kernel from that part and its own section. A dispatch whose
pipeline is still compiling is recorded, with every dispatch after it, and encoded in order when
the batch is next submitted, so a frame's missing pipelines compile together. A failed compile is
reported at that submit.

